{
 "format": 1,
 "version": "1.3.0",
 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "Note-taker: tap it in class or a meeting and it writes down what's said. When you stop, Claude turns it into neat notes: a summary, key points, terms and homework.",
  "Folders inside folders: make one inside another, or move a folder into another.",
  "Long lists fold their older notes away (Past week, Past month, Older). Tap to open one.",
  "One clipboard on all your devices: in the Clipboard tab, turn on \"Keep this phone's clipboard in step\". Copy anywhere, open Vault, then paste.",
  "Share text from any app to Vault and pick \"Copy on all my devices\".",
  "Fixed: some screens (like note history) looked unstyled on phones."
 ],
